<title>USA: Reliance Group Holdings Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Reliance Group Holdings Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended			  March 31</p>
<p>					1997	  1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		 $781.9	 $723.8</p>
<p> Operating income		 25.9	   19.6</p>
<p> Net income  (1)		  28.4	   22.5</p>
<p>Per share information:</p>
<p> Operating income		  .22	    .17</p>
<p> Net income  (1)		   .24	    .19</p>
<p>	   (in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Q1 1997 includes a $7.5 million charge ($.06 per share) for the settlement of litigation related to a discontinued insurance brokerage operation.</p>
<p>Property and casualty pretax operating income was $59.3 million in the first quarter of 1997 compared to $54.2 million in the first quarter of 1996.  The combined ratio -- the ratio of claims and expenses to earned premiums -- was 101.1 in the first quarter of 1997, compared with 101.9 in the 1996 period.</p>
</text>
